    0.5.4-dev - 2026/05/11 (f514f02) [develop]
        :brief 递归 PaperRun Agent Fabric
        - feat(agent): 新增 RecursiveAgentPolicy.v1 与 AgentExpansionDecision, 子 agent 不再受预算档固定深度限制
        - feat(agent): 子 agent 可继续派生子 agent, 由 cost/time/concurrency/context/permission/data-egress/license/authenticity/coverage 条件停止
        - feat(agent): AgentTree 记录 children、permissions、recursive_policy 与 agent.spawned/completed/blocked/expansion_skipped 事件
        - fix(runtime): appendResearchEvent 对 deterministic idFactory 重入做 event_id 去重, 避免恢复/导出阶段写坏 SQLite index
        - fix(export): forced draft 在 final gate blocker 为空时仍携带 final_gate_not_passed
        - test(agent): 覆盖 depth 3 递归、多模型子 agent、权限收窄、循环防护、gate-aware 阻断
        :src
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/agents.ts - recursive agent policy, expansion decisions, permissions, events
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/budget.ts - unbounded depth policy with budget resource caps
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/run.ts - PaperRun AgentTree snapshot and forced export blocker normalization
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/research/runtime/run-store.ts - unique event id fallback
            - packages/opencode/src/paper/observability.ts - root agent spawned event
